    "record_authority": "Fresh original groups/source reconstruct whole final records and exact original/final key-sibling values before placement and again before certifying the composed candidate. Producer projections and matching encoded keys are not certificates.",
    "wire_policy": "GrowingPreferred minimum-size serializer; distinct existing FittedDeclared wrapper unchanged.",
    "data_policy": "Represented GLOBAL/ordinary-owned/candidate cells only; actual Space Metadata moves into the same append State only for explicit JointIndexes continuation.",
    "index_policy": "Prepare all physical source trees/types before INDEX reservations; affected owners dispatched once in data-number order through the DATA append State. Fitting, root-leaf right-then-left split and recursive retained-capacity split use existing typed owners.",
    "independent_data_frontier": "CertifiedPlacement independently replays records, physical DATA pages, events, maps and phase EOF, bound to actual source/candidate buffer identities.",
    "replay_authority": "Represented / ProtectedRepresented / QualifiedCandidate separate source protection from permission to allocate candidate-map storage. Mixed DATA uses ProtectedRepresented; the existing qualified single-variable continuation retains QualifiedCandidate.",
    "source_body_inventory": "Every declared physical owner, exact reachable==owned tree inventory, alias identity, cross-owner body disjointness and catalog ordinary DATA/ColumnOwned/foreign INDEX claims are independently checked before INDEX spans are granted.",
    "index_authority": "Fresh CertifiedRows keys from original groups drive independent full typed populations and root/nonroot replay with one shared EOF and merged map-byte overlay. Final catalog/table/index/constraints/DATA membership checked before returning candidate.",
    "normal_boundary": "Separate non-journalable preview; no normal ACE writes, data-macro execution, native Access save/reopen, journal activation or directory durability qualification."
  },
